{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-local","type":"group","x":950,"y":-120,"width":2330,"height":2520,"color":"2","label":"② 当前节点：严格局部的 Planner–Executor 循环"},
		{"id":"group-global","type":"group","x":-1360,"y":-120,"width":1980,"height":2040,"color":"5","label":"① 全局任务结构与依赖调度"},
		{"id":"group-revision","type":"group","x":1935,"y":2720,"width":850,"height":900,"color":"6","label":"③ 全局维护与终止"},
		{"id":"title-tdp-flow","type":"text","text":"# Task-Decoupled Planning（TDP）Agent 执行架构\n\n**重点：信息如何在 Supervisor、DAG、Planner、Executor 与 Environment 之间流动**","x":0,"y":-420,"width":1260,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"legend-flow-types","type":"text","text":"## 图例\n\n- 青色箭头：任务、上下文、计划与动作的前向流\n- 橙色箭头：环境反馈、状态评估与局部重规划\n- 紫色箭头：批次完成后的全局 DAG 自修订","x":1300,"y":-420,"width":900,"height":220},
		{"id":"scoped-context","type":"text","text":"## Node-Scoped Context\n\n对当前节点 `nᵢ` 仅聚合：\n\n1. 当前节点 specification\n2. 前置依赖节点的结果\n3. 当前节点自己的交互轨迹 `Hᵢ`\n4. Supervisor 的必要宏观指导\n\n**不包含无关节点的完整执行历史。**","x":1000,"y":-25,"width":460,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"task-dag","type":"text","text":"## 全局 Task DAG `G`\n\n保存：\n- 节点 specification\n- 节点依赖关系\n- 节点状态\n- 已完成节点的结果\n\n只承担**任务拓扑与全局进度**，不把全部执行历史塞给局部模块。","x":150,"y":1520,"width":380,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ready-scheduler","type":"text","text":"## Supervisor：拓扑调度\n\n`GetExecutableNodes(G)`\n\n选出所有前置依赖已满足的 ready nodes，并逐个构造可独立派发的执行单元。","x":-1360,"y":360,"width":310,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"task-input","type":"text","text":"## 原始任务输入\n\n- 用户任务指令 `T`\n- 环境描述 `E`\n- 初始全局状态 `G₀`\n- 最大交互步数 `s_max`","x":-1200,"y":-75,"width":300,"height":210},
		{"id":"supervisor-decompose","type":"text","text":"## Supervisor：全局分解\n\n1. 将总体目标拆为语义独立的子任务\n2. 推断子任务的前置依赖\n3. 为每个节点生成可独立理解的 specification","x":150,"y":-85,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-outcome","type":"text","text":"## 节点结果\n\n节点结束后提交：\n- completion / failure 状态\n- 当前节点最终 outcome\n- 可供后继节点消费的精炼信息","x":1195,"y":1300,"width":410,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"supervisor-eval","type":"text","text":"## Supervisor：逐步评估\n\n输入：节点 `nᵢ`、最新 observation `o`、局部轨迹 `Hᵢ`\n\n输出：\n- `needs_more_steps`\n- `completed`\n- `failed`\n- 是否触发局部重规划 `rᵢ`\n- 可选的宏观指导","x":940,"y":645,"width":460,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"self-revision","type":"text","text":"## Self-Revision\n\n每批 ready nodes 完成后：\n\n1. 检查结果是否破坏 DAG 假设\n2. 精炼未完成节点 specification\n3. 将新约束传播给后继节点\n4. 必要时添加或删除节点\n5. 恢复可行的依赖结构","x":1995,"y":2910,"width":390,"height":330,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"paper-source","type":"link","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.07577","x":1995,"y":3405,"width":360,"height":180},
		{"id":"environment","type":"text","text":"## Environment `E`\n\n执行动作：\n\n`o = E.Step(a)`\n\n返回最新 observation `o`。","x":2685,"y":2810,"width":330,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"task-result","type":"text","text":"## 最终结果 `R`\n\n当总体任务完成，或超过 `s_max`：\n\n- 返回任务结果\n- 或返回终止状态","x":2385,"y":3480,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"local-executor","type":"text","text":"## Executor\n\n根据当前计划 `πᵢ` 与局部轨迹 `Hᵢ`，生成下一条可执行动作：\n\n`a = Ex(πᵢ, Hᵢ)`","x":2700,"y":-85,"width":330,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"locality-note","type":"text","text":"### 局部隔离规则\n\n局部失败只触发 active node 的 plan refine；已完成的前置节点与因果独立节点保持不变。环境反馈不会直接污染其他节点的上下文。","x":2865,"y":645,"width":360,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"local-planner","type":"text","text":"## Planner\n\n读取当前节点 specification 与 scoped context，生成完成该节点的结构化高层计划：\n\n`πᵢ = P(nᵢ, contextᵢ)`","x":1995,"y":-140,"width":330,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"local-trace","type":"text","text":"## 当前节点交互轨迹 `Hᵢ`\n\n持续追加：\n\n`(action a, observation o)`\n\n轨迹只属于当前节点；供 Executor、Planner refine 与 Supervisor eval 使用。","x":1945,"y":520,"width":350,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"local-replan","type":"text","text":"## Planner：节点内重规划\n\n当 observation 与预期进展显著冲突：\n\n`πᵢ′ = P.refine(nᵢ, o, Hᵢ)`\n\n只修改当前节点的计划与局部轨迹解释范围。","x":2310,"y":2000,"width":390,"height":250,"color":"2"}
	],
	"edges":[
